"1061","Sa'd bin 'Ubdda * d)l,5;s asked Allah's MessengLl d-r- fhis legal opinion (about) saying, My mothe died and she had and unfulfilled vow."" The Prophett p-r"
"1062","The Prophet (ﷺ) forbade vowing and said, ""In fact, vowing does not prevent anything, but it makes a miser to spend his property."""
"1063","The Prophet (ﷺ) said, Allah says"
"1064","Th l:"
"1065","M sistvowed tof gof on foot tof the Ka'b and she asked me tof take the verdict of the Prophett p r, r- about it. so"
